>9. Does it matter what ring-finger you use?
>	No.  Just nethack's way of keeping track.

Yes, it does.  Nethack assumes you are right handed.  Therefore, if you
put a ring on your right hand and then wield a cursed weapon, you will not
be able to remove the ring until you uncurse that weapon.  Trust me, I
found out the hard way.

